Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_1::
	.string "And... How did you find this\n"
	.string "spot?\p"
	.string "This spot belongs to non-bug POKéMON\n"
	.string "which hide from all those bugs.\p"
	.string "For example, I’ve been nursing\n"
	.string "this injured TREECKO.\p"
	.string "He’s been attacked by a very strong\n"
	.string "bug POKéMON. Poor thing...$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_2::
	.string "He’s in desperately need of a good\n"
	.string "trainer.\p"
	.string "Would you please take care of it?$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_3::
	.string "Oh, poor TREECKO...\p"
	.string "He may never find a good TRAINER\n"
	.string "to take care of him...$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_4::
	.string "How is TREECKO doing?\n"
	.string "I hope you two get along!$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_5::
	.string "Oh? Your party is full...\p"
	.string "TREECKO says he’ll wait till\n"
	.string "you make room for him...$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_6::
	.string "OK. But, TREECKO doesn’t like weak\n"
	.string "TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "That’s why I’ll battle you and\n"
	.string "show him he can trust you!$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_BeautyDefeat::
	.string "I knew you were a strong TRAINER!$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_BeautyVictory::
	.string "Oh!...\n"
	.string "What a shame...$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_7::
	.string "Have you seen that, TREECKO?\n"
	.string "This TRAINER is really strong.\p"
	.string "I’m sure he’ll be a good TRAINER\n"
	.string "for you...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "TREECKO decided to travel with you\n"
	.string "so please take it...$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Beauty_8::
	.string "{PLAYER} received a TREECKO!$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Pikachu::
	.string "PIKACHU: Pika?$"

Unused_SevenIsland_TanobyRuins_MoneanChamber_Text_Pidgeot::
	.string "PIDGEOTTO: Pijooo!$"

